## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-C kernel illustrating 32x32 tiling
void matmul_tiled(int N, const double *A, const double *B, double *C){
  for(int ii=0; ii<N; ii+=32){
    for(int jj=0; jj<N; jj+=32){
      for(int kk=0; kk<N; kk+=32){
        for(int i=ii; i< (ii+32) && i<N; ++i){
          for(int j=jj; j<(jj+32) && j<N; ++j){
            double sum = 0.0;
            for(int k=kk; k<(kk+32) && k<N; ++k){
              sum += A[i*N+k] * B[k*N+j];
            }
            C[i*N+j] += sum;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

